# Brute Force Code (Python)

```python
from math import gcd

class Solution:
    def gcdValues(self, nums, queries):
        gcdPairs = []

        n = len(nums)

        for i in range(n):
            for j in range(i + 1, n):
                gcdPairs.append(gcd(nums[i], nums[j]))

        gcdPairs.sort()

        ans = []

        for q in queries:
            ans.append(gcdPairs[q])

        return ans
```

